      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Anyhow, I do not think information will stop the conspiracy theories. (And yes, when Mythos-class unguardrailed models are available, that will also lead to a lot of issues)",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2khp6r7tc2z",
